STRATEGY trend VERSION 1

SYMBOLS
    eur = BACKTEST:EURUSD EVERY 1h WARMUP 60 BARS

RULES
    WHEN ema(eur.close, 12) CROSSES ABOVE ema(eur.close, 48)
     AND POSITION.eur = 0
    THEN BUY eur SIZING 0.01

    WHEN POSITION.eur > 0
     AND ema(eur.close, 12) CROSSES BELOW ema(eur.close, 48)
    THEN CLOSE eur
